CAN AI BE TRUSTED?

- As AI is increasingly embedded in everyday life, it is vital that people can trust AI.
    Practitioners infuse trust into AI systems with AI ethics. AI ethics is a multidisciplinary
    field that investigates how to optimize AI’s beneficial impact while reducing unintended or
    adverse outcomes. There are five pillars of AI ethics: fairness, robustness, explainability,
    transparency, and privacy. These pillars are focus areas that help make AI trustworthy.

